      <h3>TradeClaim</h3>
      <div class="dp-table-wrap"><table class="dp-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Req</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="f">id</td><td class="t">integer</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Sequential primary key (in-process; DB-backed in production)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">reference</td><td class="t">string</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Human reference: <code>TC-{YYYYMMDDHHmmSS}</code> or operator-supplied invoice ref</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">corridor</td><td class="t">object</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Resolved corridor snapshot: id, name, code, source_country, target_country, bloc, asset_code</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">institution</td><td class="t">object</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Resolved institution snapshot: id, name, swift_code, country_code</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">amount</td><td class="t">decimal</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Liquidity amount in corridor asset currency</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">currency_code</td><td class="t">string</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>ISO 4217 currency code (e.g. <code>GHS</code>, <code>NGN</code>)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">trade_direction</td><td class="t">enum</td><td class="r">✓</td><td><code>import</code> | <code>export</code> | <code>remittance</code> | <code>interbank</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">beneficiary_name</td><td class="t">string</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Full legal name of beneficiary entity</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">beneficiary_country</td><td class="t">iso3</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 of beneficiary jurisdiction</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">description</td><td class="t">text</td><td></td><td>Free-text trade description for compliance review</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">status</td><td class="t">enum</td><td class="r">✓</td><td><code>pending_review</code> | <code>approved</code> | <code>rejected</code> | <code>clarification_requested</code> | <code>cancelled</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">submitted_by</td><td class="t">string</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>Operator identity — institution name or explicit operator field</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">decision_notes</td><td class="t">text</td><td></td><td>Supervisor notes written on approve / reject / clarification</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">approved_at</td><td class="t">timestamp</td><td></td><td>ISO 8601 UTC timestamp of supervisor approval</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">rejected_at</td><td class="t">timestamp</td><td></td><td>ISO 8601 UTC timestamp of rejection</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">cancelled_at</td><td class="t">timestamp</td><td></td><td>ISO 8601 UTC timestamp of cancellation</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="f">created_at</td><td class="t">timestamp</td><td class="r">✓</td><td>ISO 8601 UTC submission timestamp</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>

      <h3>Corridor Snapshot (embedded in TradeClaim)</h3>
      <div class="dp-callout dp-info">
        <span class="dp-ci">ℹ</span>
        <div>
          Corridor data is snapshotted at claim creation time and stored directly on the claim record.
          This ensures the supervisor reviews the corridor state at origination, not a potentially
          updated live value. The snapshot includes: <code>id</code>, <code>name</code>,
          <code>code</code>, <code>source_country</code>, <code>target_country</code>,
          <code>bloc</code>, <code>asset_code</code>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>Five-Gate Issuance Eligibility</h3>
      <div class="dp-table-wrap"><table class="dp-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Gate</th><th>Description</th><th>Pass Condition</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>supervisor_approval</strong></td><td>Supervisor has explicitly approved the claim</td><td>Status == <code>approved</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>compliance</strong></td><td>AML, document validation, beneficiary verification</td><td>No compliance flags blocking issuance</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>corridor_limits</strong></td><td>Amount within daily cap, per-tx cap, velocity limit</td><td>All three limits headroom ≥ amount</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>liquidity</strong></td><td>Corridor reserve pool has sufficient available balance</td><td>Net position ≥ claimed amount</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>governance</strong></td><td>No open governance proposals blocking the corridor</td><td>No pending halt or freeze proposals</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>

