    <!-- §5 Validation -->
    <div class="dp-section" id="validation">
      <div class="dp-section-header">
        <div class="dp-section-num">§5</div>
        <h2>Validation Rules</h2>
      </div>

      <h3>Client-Side (pre-submit)</h3>
      <div class="dp-rule">Country must be selected before SWIFT options are available</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">Corridor must be selected before institution dropdown enables</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">Institution must be selected before submit button enables</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">amount &gt; 0</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">beneficiary_name.length ≥ 2</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">trade_direction must be one of: import | export | remittance | interbank</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">All required fields (*) must be non-empty</div>

      <h3>Server-Side (on POST /api/v2/trade_claims)</h3>
      <div class="dp-rule">corridor_id must resolve to an existing, non-frozen corridor in STUB_CORRIDORS</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">institution_id must resolve to a registered commercial bank in STUB_BANKS</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">amount must be a positive numeric value</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">currency_code derived from corridor; submitted value validated against corridor asset_code</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">Reference uniqueness checked within session scope (duplicate within 60s returns existing record)</div>

      <h3>Compliance Pre-Screening (automated at supervisor desk)</h3>
      <div class="dp-rule">DocumentValidationService → document_status: checks invoice reference format</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">AMLCheckService → aml_status: jurisdiction screening on beneficiary_country</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">LimitCheckService → limit_status: amount vs. corridor daily cap + velocity limit</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">BeneficiaryVerificationService → beneficiary_status: name + country cross-check</div>
      <div class="dp-rule">ComplianceStatusAggregator → pre_cleared | manual_review | blocked</div>

      <div class="dp-callout dp-warn">
        <span class="dp-ci">⚠</span>
        <div>A <code>blocked</code> compliance status prevents supervisor approval. The supervisor cannot override a blocked status — the originating operator must correct the claim data and resubmit.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

