    <!-- §9 End-to-End Flow -->
    <div class="dp-section" id="flow">
      <div class="dp-section-header">
        <div class="dp-section-num">§9</div>
        <h2>End-to-End Workflow</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Complete walkthrough: NGA → GHA corridor, Access Bank Ghana, import liquidity claim.</p>
      <div class="dp-flow">
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Open Trade Claim modal</h4><p>Operator clicks "New Trade Claim" on sandbox dashboard. Modal opens. Corridors load from <code>GET /api/v2/corridors</code>. Countries load from <code>GET /api/v2/countries</code>.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Select Claiming Institution country</h4><p>Operator selects Ghana (GHA) from country dropdown. Central Bank SWIFT options load (BGHGGHAC). CB name auto-fills: "Bank of Ghana". CB holder ID resolves silently.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Select Trade Corridor</h4><p>Operator selects "🇳🇬 NGA → 🇬🇭 GHA — GHS" from corridor list. <code>onCorridorChange()</code> fires. Commercial banks from Ghana load into institution dropdown.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Select Institution</h4><p>Operator selects "Access Bank Ghana" from institution dropdown. SWIFT code auto-fills (ABGHGHAC). <code>resolveCommercialBankHolderId()</code> calls <code>GET /api/v2/holder_keys?swift_code=ABGHGHAC</code>. Holder ID resolved from <code>commercial_bank_holder_keys</code> DB table.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Complete Trade Details</h4><p>Trade Direction: Import. Amount: 500,000. Currency auto-shows: GHS. Beneficiary Name: "Accra Trading Co. Ltd". Beneficiary Country: GHA. Description: "Q2 goods import settlement".</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Submit</h4><p>Operator clicks Submit. <code>POST /api/v2/trade_claims</code> fires. Server resolves corridor and institution snapshots. Status set to <code>pending_review</code>. Reference <code>TC-20260519142233</code> assigned. HTTP 201 returned.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Supervisor queue</h4><p>Claim appears in Supervisor Desk pending queue. Compliance pre-screening runs automatically: AML clear, limits within bounds, beneficiary verified → <code>pre_cleared</code>.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Supervisor approval</h4><p>Supervisor opens claim, reviews five gates, adds notes, clicks Approve. <code>POST /api/v2/trade_claims/1/approve</code>. All gates return <code>passed: true</code>. Status → <code>approved</code>.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Settlement</h4><p>Approved claim triggers corridor liquidity drawdown. CBDC issuance authorisation created. Audit record finalised with full chain-of-custody.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="dp-callout dp-ok">
        <span class="dp-ci">✓</span>
        <div>End state: Claim TC-20260519142233 approved. Corridor NGA→GHA liquidity drawn for 500,000 GHS. Access Bank Ghana Commercial Bank Holder ID linked. Full audit trail immutably recorded from origination through approval.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

